  "notes": "Adds Windows split-screen/Snap support while preserving the current app and section audit. The Files can now resize down to half-screen width beside Edge; at narrow widths the section bookmarks move into two compact rows, the header and bottom navigation reflow, and the book keeps readable full-width pages with horizontal page scrolling. No Overview fields or character data are changed."
